  "answer": "The approval process for purchasing a new software tool involves the following steps:\n\n1. The employee submits a procurement request through the internal purchase portal.\n2. The employee's department manager must approve the software purchase before it is reviewed by Finance.\n3. Once approved by the department manager, Finance reviews the request and assigns a purchase order number to the approved software purchase.\n\nNote that there is no indication in the provided context that the employee is required to use a personal card to make the purchase immediately, as suggested in [4].",
